        <p>D—TDI,EY HOUSE, DORKING.—Home School for the daughters of gentlemen. Principal,EieWarsna. High-class Education based upon Iniristiaa principles. Pupils prepared for all public examinations. Pees very moderate. Autumn term commenced September 17th.</p>
