        <p>EAST DEVON County School, Sampford Pavere Tiverton.—Estabtished 1655 ; 6 ache arships, graduated fees lessening each year, no extras, ju dor Civil service examination, 57th and 101st out of 7541. 101 Division and 2 II Division out of 13 candidates, 9) other suoa-sses. swimm- ing bath 170 ft., 12 miles of boating, excellent diet, re.erencea to parents. Six scholarships offered.</p>
