      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1895-09-28_WidnesExaminer_art0014" n="art0014">
        <head>SHOW THIS TO SOME WOMAN.</head>
        <p>SHOW THIS TO SOME WOMAN.</p>
        <p>I will send a valuable. instructive, and highly Interestiny, book which eve-y woman would be glad to have Contains important and confidential advice and tells both married and single how to keep healthy and avoid the nxieties so distressing to the sex. Sent free, securely ealed, for one stamp to cover postage. ADDRESS : Professor 113. LASALLE, 17, Eastbourne Terrace Paddington. London, W,</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1895-09-28_WidnesExaminer_art0015" n="art0015">
        <gap reason="ocrQuality" quantity="1" unit="words">
