        <p>PORTABLE ENGINES, from 2 t,o 8 h.-p. from £2O each; also Eight Threshing Machines and Elevators ; Trac- tion Engines. 6 and 8 h.-p —Addre 5 FOLEY BR'S., Bourne.</p>
        <p>GRATEFUL.</p>
